01b[38;5;28;01mreturn\u001b[39;00m _IncompatibleKeys(missing_keys, unexpected_keys)\n",
      "\u001b[0;31mRuntimeError\u001b[0m: Error(s) in loading state_dict for DisentangledTransformer:\n\tsize mismatch for layer1.W_q.weight: copying a param with shape torch.Size([220, 220]) from checkpoint, the shape in current model is torch.Size([500, 220]).\n\tsize mismatch for layer1.W_k.weight: copying a param with shape torch.Size([220, 220]) from checkpoint, the shape in current model is torch.Size([500, 220]).\n\tsize mismatch for layer1.W_v.weight: copying a param with shape torch.Size([220, 220]) from checkpoint, the shape in current model is torch.Size([500, 220]).\n\tsize mismatch for layer1.W_o.weight: copying a param with shape torch.Size([220, 220]) from checkpoint, the shape in current model is torch.Size([500, 500]).\n\tsize mismatch for layer2.W_q.weight: copying a param with shape torch.Size([220, 440]) from checkpoint, the shape in current model is torch.Size([500, 720]).\n\tsize mismatch for layer2.W_k.weight: copying a param with shape torch.Size([220, 440]) from checkpoint, the shape in current model is torch.Size([500, 720]).\n\tsize mismatch for layer2.W_v.weight: copying a param with shape torch.Size([220, 440]) from checkpoint, the shape in current model is torch.Size([500, 720]).\n\tsize mismatch for layer2.W_o.weight: copying a param with shape torch.Size([220, 220]) from checkpoint, the shape in current model is torch.Size([500, 500]).\n\tsize mismatch for fc_out.weight: copying a param with shape torch.Size([20, 660]) from checkpoint, the shape in current model is torch.Size([20, 1220])."
